# Privacy Policy for Tezbazar

**Last Updated:** September 24, 2026

**Tezbazar** ("we", "our", or "us") respects your privacy and is committed to protecting it. This Privacy Policy explains how information about you is handled when you use the **Tezbazar** mobile application (the "App").

---

## 1. Overview & Data Ownership

Tezbazar is an offline-first Point of Sale (POS) and inventory management application. 

- **100% Local Storage:** All products, sales history, customer records, cashiers, debt details, and store configuration entered into Tezbazar are stored exclusively **on your local device**.
- **No External Data Uploads:** We do not collect, transmit, rent, or sell your store management data, customer details, or transaction records to external servers or third parties.

---

## 2. Device Permissions & Usage

### Camera Permission (`android.permission.CAMERA`)
- **Usage:** Used solely to scan product barcodes using on-device machine learning (Google ML Kit).
- **Data Handling:** Camera frames are processed strictly in real-time memory on your device to extract barcode numbers. Camera images are **never captured, stored, or transmitted**.

---

## 3. Data Backup & Export

- Tezbazar allows you to voluntarily export your store data as CSV files to your device's local storage or restore data from CSV backups.
- Backup files are saved locally on your device and are fully managed by you.

---

## 4. Third-Party Services & Advertising

The App integrates trusted third-party service providers that may collect non-personal information used to identify your device in accordance with their privacy policies:

### Google Mobile Ads (AdMob)
- Used to serve banner and interstitial advertisements in the App.
- Google AdMob may collect device identifiers (e.g., Advertising ID), non-personal diagnostic data, and approximate location data to deliver relevant ads and detect fraud.
- **Privacy Policy:** [Google AdMob Privacy Policy](https://policies.google.com/privacy)

### Google Play Services & ML Kit
- Used for local barcode processing and essential app framework services.
- **Privacy Policy:** [Google Play Services Policy](https://policies.google.com/privacy)

---

## 5. Data Security

Since your business data resides locally on your device, its security relies on your device's security controls. We recommend protecting your device with a PIN, password, or biometric lock.

---

## 6. Children's Privacy

Tezbazar is a business point-of-sale utility app intended for commercial and general business use. It does not knowingly collect personal identifiable information from children under the age of 13.

---

## 7. Changes to This Privacy Policy

We may update our Privacy Policy periodically. Any changes will be published here with an updated "Last Updated" date.

